1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Silva! Do it now!

2
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
[Silva grunts]

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[explosion]

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
[theme music playing]

5
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,000
FAKE x AND x PSYCHE

6
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
[thunder clapping]

7
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:31,000
[indistinct chatter]

8
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
[man 1] Hey! What the hell is going on?

9
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,000
[man 2] It came from below
There was a huge explosion underneath us.

10
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,000
I'm through with waiting!
I’m gonna go see for myself!

11
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
[Bean] Everyone, calm down.

12
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Moments ago, we were able to get
in touch with the Ten Dons.

13
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,000
They wish to speak to you directly
through a live video feed.

14
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,000
The auction will proceed as planned,
so try to remain calm.

15
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Please enter the auction hall
on the tenth floor.

16
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
[executive 1] I'll be fine.
This is on the tenth floor.

17
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,000
I'll be safe as long
as I don't go downstairs.

18
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
[executive 2] It'll be alright.
Her fortunes are 100 percent accurate.

19
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,000
[executive 3] As long as you heed
the warning, her fortunes won’t come true.

20
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Nothing to worry about.

21
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
[electricity surging]

22
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Hey. How is everybody doing?

23
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,000
First, I apologize for being
out of touch. Sorry.

24
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Things got a little bit messy there,
but everything is fine now.

25
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:47,000
The leader of the infamous Phantom Troupe
has been dealt with.

26
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
[indistinct chatter]

27
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:53,000
It's only a matter of time
before we get to the rest of them.

28
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:56,000
So leave all the hunting
to the professionals

29
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,000
and enjoy the rest of your auction.

30
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
[audience cheering]

31
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,000
Tonight is a special occasion,
so we’ll be watching live.

32
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:07,000
And of course, we look forward
to seeing some serious bidding.

33
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
You heard it for yourselves, gentlemen.

34
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,000
The Ten Dons will be watching
a live feed of the proceedings.

35
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Please concentrate on the auction.

36
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:32,000
[fly buzzing]

37
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:42,000
[thunder crashing]

38
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,000
[phone ringing]

39
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
That you, Illumi?

40
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,000
[Illumi] Yeah. Where's my client?

41
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[Silva] He's here.

42
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,000
[Zeno groaning]

43
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Oh. Were you two just fighting?
So, is he still alive?

44
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:23,000
Just in the nick of time.
Good. Give him a message for me.

45
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:27,000
We've disposed of the Ten Dons.

46
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:31,000
And tell him to wire the money
to the account. He knows the one.

47
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Up we go. Well, what a surprise.

48
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Seems we both get to live another day.

49
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,000
[Chrollo] But your mission?

50
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,000
[Zeno]
The Ten Dons were our clients, you see.

51
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:47,000
And so now that they’ve all been
disposed of, things have changed.

52
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
You are no longer our target.

53
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,000
Huh. I see.

54
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,000
You won't get another chance like this.

55
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,000
Perhaps. But you don’t really think
we’re in this business

56
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,000
for the fun of it, do you?

57
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:05,000
It’s not as if we take any pleasure
in killing.

58
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
And I certainly don’t want to work
or die for nothing.

59
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:13,000
I was the one who commissioned Illumi
to assassinate the Ten Dons.

60
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Did you know that?

61
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Of course, I did. But that is irrelevant.
Makes no difference.

62
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
We simply do the job we're hired to do
and nothing more.

63
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,000
I understand.

64
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:27,000
-So, can I ask you something?
-[Zeno grunts]

65
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:32,000
If we were to fight, just the two of us,
which of us would win?

66
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Hmm. I would.
There's no question about it.

67
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Though it would be
a different story altogether

68
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,000
if you were actually trying to kill me.

69
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,000
Damn insolent brat.

70
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,000
[Chrollo] So he knew?

71
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,000
[sighs]

72
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,000
[thudding]

73
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,000
I'm so beat!

74
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,000
I’ve no chance
of stealing their abilities.

75
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
[Melody] So, you want us to wait
at Hospital L?

76
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,000
[Kurapika] Yes, it's more dangerous here
than we thought.

77
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
We'll send her over by ambulance
in a short while.

78
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,000
[doctor] She's just unconscious,
so you shouldn't have to worry.

79
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:35,000
But she'll certainly be a lot safer
at the hospital than she is here.

80
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Make the preparations.

81
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
[Franklin] Looks like you had fun, boss.
You doing okay?

82
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
[Chrollo] Yeah. Just a little tired,
that’s all.

83
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,000
You did go up against the Zoldyck family.

84
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,000
I wish I’d been there to see.

85
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Watching how those two fought you
would have been very informative.

86
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:59,000
[Feitan]
Fighting would be more fun than watching.

87
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
Kortopi, are we all ready
to do the next step?

88
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:09,000
Of course. I can't make living copies,
just ones that don't move.

89
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
[Chrollo] Good enough.
We'll stick to the plan.

90
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,000
Also...

91
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:20,000
[sighs] Don't touch the ambulance
that's carrying the girl.

92
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
You really think that we'll be safe
on the trip over?

93
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
If they were planning
to attack the ambulance,

94
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
they would've done so on its way here.

95
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Stray bullets shouldn't be a concern
anymore, either.

96
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,000
[auctioneer] It's the moment
you've been waiting for!

97
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:44,000
Get ready, because this auction
is about to begin!

98
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,000
[audience applauding]

99
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,000
If you would,
please allow me to introduce

100
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:52,000
the first item of the evening!

101
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:55,000
[Bean sighs] I was getting worried there
for a moment.

102
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,000
But all's well that ends well.

103
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,000
None of the leaders were hurt.
So, at least there's that.

104
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,000
We did alright.

105
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Hmm?

106
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,000
Thank you.

107
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
-Huh?
-[Hisoka snickers]

108
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Coming up next,
another splendid item for you!

109
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:31,000
A solid gold execution sword,
direct from the Yul National Treasury!

110
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,000
[audience exclaiming]

111
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Bidding starts at 20 million!

112
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
-[man 1] 40 million!
-[man 2] 50!

113
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,000
[auctioneer] I hear 50 million Jenny.
Thank you, sir.

114
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,000
[man 3] One hundred million!

115
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,000
I guess I can put him on autopilot. There.

116
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:52,000
Next, we have a Celadon porcelain vase
from the Lai Dynasty.

117
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
It’s still completely intact,

118
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:58,000
and is, without a doubt, the very last
of its kind in the entire world.

119
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:02,000
Okay, so where’s the Celadon vase? Um…

120
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,000
Here it is.

121
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Kortopi, this one is next.

122
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,000
Here, I'll leave it to you.

123
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,000
Okay.

124
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,000
[audience exclaiming]

125
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
[auctioneer]
And here’s the Celadon vase now!

126
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Let's start the bidding off
at 100 million!

127
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
-[man 1] 200 million!
-[man 2] 330!

128
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,000
[man 3] 380!

129
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,000
[sirens wailing]

130
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:33,000
[guard] Hey, you there.

131
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Aren't you gonna participate
in the auction?

132
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
What are you talking about?

133
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
The leader of the Phantom Troupe
was killed.

134
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,000
-[gasping]
-[guard 2] Moving ahead as planned.

135
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,000
But that's impossible.

136
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,000
It can't be.

137
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,000
[guard] They're hunting down
the stragglers now.

138
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,000
[guard 2]
They don't call 'em pros for nothing.

139
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,000
[Zenji chuckling]

140
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:01,000
While your useless ass was busy
wasting time with the ambulance,

141
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:05,000
it looks like the Zoldycks
actually stepped up and got the job done.

142
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:08,000
And since there's no real need
for you any longer,

143
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:12,000
why don't you just run along and suck up
to your fortuneteller girl?

144
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:16,000
Head over to the hospital,
maybe the hotel, eh?

145
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:19,000
Or even better, how about you go
and lick the boots

146
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:22,000
of that old fraud who's just
as useless as you?

147
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,000
Sound good? [yelps]

148
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,000
[Kurapika] I won't believe it
until I see it with my own eyes.

149
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,000
[man 1] This is the leader?
He's young.

150
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Too young to be messing with us.

151
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,000
[man 2]
Hey, don't damage him from the neck up.

152
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,000
We're gonna put his face on the Internet.

153
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,000
[man 3] We found the other members!

154
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,000
[man 4] Right, I'm on my way.

155
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Five bodies, total?
Try to identify them.

156
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
DNA, teeth, fingerprints.
Check all the databases.

157
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
And whatever you do,
don't touch their heads.

158
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,000
[man 5] Once we know who they are,
we'll kill their relatives,

159
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,000
their lovers, everyone!

160
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Make sure the whole world knows
that this is what happens

161
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
when you screw with us like this.

162
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,000
[Kurapika grunting]

163
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:34,000
[panting]

164
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:37,000
[auctioneer] Alright, everyone.
This is it!

165
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:41,000
It's time for our very last item
of the night!

166
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:46,000
One of the seven most beautiful colors
in the world, the Scarlet Eyes!

167
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,000
[audience exclaiming]

168
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
[auctioneer]
Now that the Kurta Clan's extinct,

169
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
only 36 pairs will ever exist.

170
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:57,000
This particular pair exhibits
an exceptionally brilliant scarlet.

171
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:01,000
So, let's start the bidding
at 100 million!

172
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,000
-[man 1] 110 million!
-[dialing]

173
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,000
[man 2] 120!

174
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,000
[man 3] 130!

175
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,000
-[man 1] 150!
-[call connects]

176
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,000
-[Kurapika] Boss?
-A-hundred-seventy!

177
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,000
-[Kurapika] It's Kurapika.
-[bidding continues]

178
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:14,000
[Kurapika] I apologize.
I predicted incorrectly.

179
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
The leader of the Spiders is dead

180
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:18,000
and the auction is proceeding
as scheduled.

181
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,000
[Nostrade] What?

182
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,000
[Kurapika] The Scarlet Eyes
are being auctioned as we speak.

183
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:26,000
-Should I bid?
-Of course! You must win them.

184
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
Is there a limit, sir?

185
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,000
No! Bid whatever it takes to win them.

186
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,000
Yes, sir. I understand.

187
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,000
-[man 4] 300!
-I hear 300 million Jenny!

188
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Do I have any other bids out there?
Anyone at all?

189
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
-[Kurapika] 350!
-[gasps]

190
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,000
[man 1] 360!

191
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
[man 2] 370!

192
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,000
[man 3] 390!

193
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Five hundred!

194
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,000
[Zenji] One billion.

195
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
[gasping]

196
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,000
[snickering]

197
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:02,000
[Nostrade] 2.9 billion?

198
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[Kurapika] Yes, sir. That's right.

199
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Unfortunately, I got into a bidding war

200
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,000
with the bald man
from the assassin's meeting.

201
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Zenji, huh? Damn it.

202
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:15,000
[Nostrade] I didn't expect him
to spend this much.

203
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Curse that loathsome pig.

204
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,000
But no matter.

205
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:22,000
This means more money for the community,

206
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:25,000
which will only serve to bolster
my prestige.

207
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,000
As long as I have Neon's fortunetelling,
I can make it back.

208
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:35,000
Fine. It won't be a problem.
You did well, so thank you.

209
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,000
That's right.

210
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:40,000
This is just an investment
in my journey to the top.

211
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:46,000
In order to succeed, it's imperative
that I keep Neon happy.

212
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:50,000
She's my secret weapon.

213
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Now and forever.

214
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:04,000
As long as I have her... [snickering]
I'll have all the money I could ever want.

215
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:13,000
[auctioneer]
You're from the Nostrade Family?

216
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Congratulations on your winning bid.

217
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,000
Please confirm that this is your item.

218
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
[Kurapika] Yeah.

219
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,000
[Zenji] You bastard.

220
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,000
Did you really think
you could get away from me?

221
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:16,000
Hold it! Or I'll blow your head off!

222
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,000
Move.

223
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
You little...

224
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:22,000
[grunting]

225
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,000
Don't tempt me right now.

226
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,000
I don’t care who I lash out at.

227
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:29,000
[whimpering]

228
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:33,000
[Kurapika] It might as well be you.

229
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:37,000
[groaning]

230
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
[panting]

231
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:58,000
Who in the hell... is that kid?

232
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
[panting continues]

233
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,000
[Leorio and Zepile laughing]

234
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,000
[Leorio] Let the good times roll!

235
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,000
How's about another?

236
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,000
[Killua] Really?

237
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:16,000
We were captured and these two
were sitting here drinking?

238
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:19,000
Hey! You're back, huh?
Join the party!

239
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Come on, have a drink with us.

240
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:24,000
Idiot. We’re not old enough
to drink alcohol!

241
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,000
And I'm pretty sure you're not either,
are you?

242
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Who cares if I'm not?
Hey, where I come from,

243
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,000
you can start drinking
as soon as you’re 16!

244
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
[Killua] I see.

245
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Man. Look, I had no idea.
I’m just amazed you both got out alive.

246
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:46,000
Wow, I never realized
that the Phantom Troupe was so dangerous.

247
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Oh! We actually used one of the tricks
that you taught us, Mr. Zepile.

248
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,000
-It really came in handy!
-Huh?

249
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,000
[crashing]

250
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,000
[Gon] If the exit is blocked...

251
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:01,000
[Killua] You’ve just gotta make your own!

252
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,000
[Zepile] I get it.

253
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:08,000
Even though I wasn’t there,
I’m glad I was able to help in some way.

254
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,000
[Zepile exhales]

255
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,000
I hadn't thought about it that way, but...

256
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,000
a little bit of con artistry
might actually go a long way

257
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:21,000
-against the Phantom Troupe.
-[Leorio] Right!

258
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:23,000
Forgery is the way to go!

259
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:27,000
You see, guys, I haven’t just
been drinking myself silly.

260
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:30,000
I’ve been learning a whole lot
from Zepile, here.

261
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
And tomorrow morning,
we'll hit up the auction.

262
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,000
You guys are coming too, right?

263
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,000
I'd like to, but I need to find Kurapika
and learn all about Nen.

264
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
Kurapika? So you got through to him?

265
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Yep. But we’re waiting for him
to call us back.

266
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:49,000
Wait. You say you’re going to learn
about Nen from him?

267
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
-Yeah, that's right.
-Why?

268
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,000
He just learned about Nen
himself, didn't he?

269
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:58,000
Sure, but Kurapika managed to defeat
a member of the Phantom Troupe.

270
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:01,000
-Seriously?
-Yeah.

271
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,000
He knows something about it we don’t.
He has to.

272
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:10,000
Like a strength that doesn’t need power
or even experience to make it work.

273
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,000
[Neon squealing]

274
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:17,000
Awesome! Thank you so much, Daddy!

275
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
[giggles] So pretty!

276
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:22,000
[Nostrade chuckles]

277
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,000
So, am I off the hook now?

278
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:26,000
[Neon] Uh huh! I forgive you!

279
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:29,000
Well, that’s certainly good to hear.

280
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:32,000
[Neon laughing]

281
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,000
Good work, all of you.

282
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:42,000
My daughter’s condition has improved
so we’ll be heading back to the hotel.

283
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:47,000
Tomorrow, we need to buy
that actor’s used tissue.

284
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,000
And that will be the end of the auction.

285
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,000
The day after tomorrow,
I’ll leave first thing in the morning.

286
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:57,000
However, I want you to accompany
my daughter while she shops.

287
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,000
[all groaning]

288
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,000
[Melody] Kurapika.

289
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,000
Don’t worry about the rest of the auction
and the shopping trip.

290
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
We’ll handle it ourselves.

291
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,000
You should get some rest, okay?

292
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,000
Yes, you’re right.

293
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:22,000
Thanks. I think I will.

294
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
[Basho] Is he really okay?

295
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:39,000
[dialing]

296
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,000
[Gon] Hello? Kurapika?

297
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,000
Yeah.

298
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:50,000
You said you wanted
to stop the Troupe, right?

299
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:53,000
Well, that won’t be necessary now.

300
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,000
The Spiders are dead.

301
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,000
[Gon gasps] What do you mean?
Kurapika?

302
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,000
[dial tone]

303
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,000
[Hisoka] Hmm. What a shame.

304
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:13,000
And here I was trying
to lift his spirits a little.

305
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:19,000
[Feitan]
The Mafia community was nothing special.

306
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,000
[Shalnark] We didn't even need Nobunaga!

307
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,000
[Nobunaga] Hey, shut up!

308
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,000
So, what'd he say?

309
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
That the Phantom Troupe's dead.

310
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
-They're what?
-You're kidding me!

311
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:30,000
[Gon] And then he hung up.

312
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,000
I guess I can’t find out any more…

313
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,000
[sighs]

314
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:48,000
[narrator] Kurapika is now drowning
in an indescribable emptiness.

315
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,000
[theme music playing]

316
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,000
-[Gon] Coming up, Gon...
-[Killua] And Killua's...

317
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,000
[both] Hunterpedia!

318
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,000
-I'm Gon!
-I'm Killua!

319
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,000
[both] And this is our Hunterpedia!

320
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:09,000
Today, we’ll introduce Kortopi,
a Troupe member!

321
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,000
Keep an eye out for Gallery Fake!

322
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:13,000
He touches something with his left hand
and conjures a copy with his right.

323
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:16,000
-I might be a fake too, you know?
-What?

324
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,000
[Gon] Next time:
"Fortunes Aren't Right?"

325
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:25,000
[Killua] My horoscope's terrible today.

326
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:27,000
[Gon] Hey! A Choco Robo on the ground!

327
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[Killua] Lucky me!
So much for that horoscope!
